# Rules here take precedence over the repository root .gitignore for everything
# under Aalok/, so the artifacts the app needs at runtime are un-ignored at the
# bottom of this file as well as at the root — a negation in the root file alone
# would lose to the broad patterns below.

# Large training data (regenerable / sourced from public datasets)
Dashboard/Bulk PCAPS/
Dashboard/Temp_CSVs/
Dashboard/archive/
Dashboard/archive */
Dashboard/archive (1)/

# PCAP captures — real traffic, including credential material
*.pcap
*.pcapng
Dashboard/evidence/

# Trained model artifacts (regenerated by trainai.py / trainai_rf.py)
*.pkl

# Live runtime artifacts
*.db
*.db.demo-backup
ids_logs.db
live_threat_logs.csv
temp_live.pcap
temp_raw.csv
retrain_state.json

# Generated training CSVs (regenerable from PCAPs)
Dashboard/master_behavioral_dataset.csv
Dashboard/master_advanced_dataset.csv
Dashboard/ai_ready_advanced_flows.csv
*.preanon-backup

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code session data
.claude/

# Spec reference docs (kept local only)
image.png
image (*).png
Teaching Plan*.pdf
Hybrid Intrusion Detection*.pdf
Major_Project_Direction.pdf

# Coursework and personal material
Weeks/
Final Report and Slides/
WEEKLY_JOURNALS.md
WEEKLY_JOURNALS_V2.md
EXTRA_FEATURES.md

# Installer build artifacts (PyInstaller + Inno Setup output)
build/
dist/
installer/output/
*.spec.bak
Hybrid IDS/

# Installed app footprint (when the user runs the installer locally)
Hybrid IDS/

# Launcher runtime log
launcher.log

# Notifier secrets (SMTP creds, webhook URLs) — template ships as .example
Dashboard/notifier_config.json

# Operator-specific baseline whitelist (real host/network IPs) — template ships as .example
Dashboard/baseline.txt

# Claude Code project-instruction file (local-only)
CLAUDE.md

# ── Un-ignored: published on purpose ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The models the dashboard loads at runtime. A clone without these has no
# classifier and quietly degrades to the K-Means fallback.
!Dashboard/rf_model.pkl
!Dashboard/rf_scaler.pkl
!Dashboard/advanced_data_scaler.pkl
!Dashboard/advanced_kmeans_model.pkl
!Dashboard/lstm_model.pt

# Evidence behind SPEC_METRICS.md. Source IP column is pseudonymised; it is an
# identifier, never a model input, so the published metrics still reproduce.
!Dashboard/ai_ready_advanced_flows.csv

# The six live Kali attack tests — the project's real detection evidence.
!TEST_RESULTS.md
